window.products.push({"id":155022,"name":"316415900 Bake Element Range/Oven by Beaquicy - Fit for Frigi-daire Cros-ley Oven/Range - For fefl79dsd feflm605dcd fefl79dsf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xe07xb+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟑𝟏𝟔𝟒𝟏𝟓𝟗𝟎𝟎 𝑹𝒂𝒏𝒈𝒆/𝑶𝒗𝒆𝒏 𝑩𝒂𝒌𝒆 𝑬𝒍𝒆𝒎𝒆𝒏𝒕】: The 316415900 Range Oven Bake Heating Element is located at the bottom of the oven. Used to provide heat to the oven. ➤The element has a rated power of 3500W and a rated voltage of 240V. The size is approximately width 15.7 inches x length 19.1 inches. Width between the Terminals is 13 inches. The element has 4 small mounting brackets. 【𝑯𝒊𝒈𝒉-𝑻𝒆𝒎𝒑𝒆𝒓𝒂𝒕𝒖𝒓𝒆 𝑹𝒆𝒔𝒊𝒔𝒕𝒂𝒏𝒕 𝑴𝒂𝒕𝒆𝒓𝒊𝒂𝒍】: The 316415900 Oven Bake Element is made from high quality materials and rigorously manufactured to ensure a long service life.The two terminals and the small holder at the body are made of metal and have a nickel-plated surface for increased resistance to high temperatures and oxidation. The body of the element is made of high temperature resistant metal with good thermal conductivity and heat resistance. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝒂𝒚𝒔 𝑾𝒂𝒓𝒓𝒂𝒏𝒕𝒚】: The Oven Range Bake Element 316415900 support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ➤High quality oven baking elements produce more even heat, are more resistant to high temperatures and are less likely to melt and break due to high temperatures. The four small brackets on the element allow them to be placed horizontally and are less likely to warp and deform. ➤If element is broken, the oven will have the following conditions, and the element need to be REPLACED IN TIME: The oven not heating. Uneven heating. The heating element broke. 【𝑭𝒊𝒕𝒔 𝑴𝒂𝒏𝒚 𝑴𝒐𝒅𝒆𝒍𝒔】: The 316415900 Oven Bake Heating Element can fits for Cros-ley, Frigi-daire oven. 316415900 Bake Heating Element Replaces models: 1062380, AP3776837, PS977844, EAP977844. ➤316415900 Bake Heating Element Suitable for: FEFLM605DCE, FEFLM605DCG, FEFLM605DCH, FEFLM605DCJ, FEFLM605DQD, FEFLM605DSD, FEFLMC55FCA, FEFLMC55FCB, FEFLMC55FCC, PLEFMZ99ECF, CGLEF379DCM, PLEFZ398ECB, GLEF369DCH, GLEF379DBK, GLEF384GSA, GLEF369DBJ, GLEF379DSJ, GLEF369DBA, GLEF369DBB, CCRE380GBBA, CCRE380GSSA, CCRE380GWWA, CRE3890GBBA, CRE3890GSSA, CRE3890GWWA, etc. 【𝑩𝒓𝒊𝒏𝒈𝒊𝒏𝒈 𝑪𝒐𝒏𝒗𝒆𝒏𝒊𝒆𝒏𝒄𝒆 𝒕𝒐 𝒀𝒐𝒖𝒓 𝑳𝒊𝒇𝒆】: The installation of 316415900 Range Oven Bake Element is simple. Before making repairs, disconnect the power and put on your work gloves. You only need to remove the screw that connect the element to the oven. Gently pull out the old element, disconnect the wires connected to the element and remove the old element, replace it with the new one and install it in the reverse order. You can save money on replacing your oven or hiring a repairman.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Xe07xb+qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0BG562NXZ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG562NXZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG562NXZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
