window.products.push({"id":155267,"name":"BRAMA Apartment Size Refrigerator 21 Cu. Ft. Full Fridge for Kitchen, Apartment, Pantry, Garage, House with Adjustable Glass Shelves and Blue LED Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51l6BsSxzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed as the perfect blend of style and functionality, the Brama 300-Series Pantry Refrigerator is a great addition to your home. With its sleek black cabinet body and door, complemented by a pole handle, this refrigerator adds a touch of elegance to any pantry or garage. Its versatile design allows it to blend seamlessly into any home setting while providing enhanced insulation for discreet use. Equipped with special insulation in both the cabinet and door, this refrigerator can withstand temperature changes in various climates, ensuring optimal performance in warmer or colder environments. The single temperature zone is specifically designed to store beverages at the perfect temperature, guaranteeing a refreshing experience every time. The glass shelves not only provide ample storage space but also serve as a stylish display for your items. With the user-friendly digital control panel, adjusting the temperature to suit your needs is effortless, ensuring that all your goods are stored under the exact same conditions. Plus, you have the flexibility to switch the interior blue LED lighting on or off with a simple button press. Thanks to its front exhaust design, integrating this refrigerator into existing cabinetry or using it freestanding is a breeze. The adjustable shelves enable you to customize storage configurations for different items, accommodating your specific needs. For a complete garage or pantry setup, consider pairing the Brama Pantry Refrigerator with the EL-300GFEB-L Garage Dual-Zone Wine Cooler (Left Hinge). This combination allows you to create a matching left and right setting, providing a cohesive look while ensuring optimal storage for both wine and other beverages.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51l6BsSxzoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRAMA","source_asin":"B08ZBYV1DW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08ZBYV1DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08ZBYV1DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
