window.products.push({"id":155297,"name":"LG : WM2455HG 27 Front-Load XL Washer - Pearl Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5137vioO9kL._AC_.jpg","description":"LG Electronics pursues its 21st century vision of becoming a true global digital leader who can make its customers worldwide happy through its innovative digital products and services. LG Electronics set its mid- and long-term vision anew to rank among the top 3 electronics, information, and telecommunication firms in the world by 2010. As such, they embrace the philosophy of Great Company, Great People, whereby only great people can create a great company, and pursue two growth strategies involving fast innovation and fast growth. Likewise, they seek to secure three core capabilities: product leadership, market leadership, and people-centered leadership. XL Front Load Stackable Washing Machine with 9 Washing Programs Ultra Capacity with NeveRust Stainless Steel Drum The largest capacity front load washer for the consumer market which means fewer loads, easy handling of large comforters and better water and energy efficiency. Intelligent Electronic Controls with Dual LED Display and Dial-A-Cycle Intuitive controls allow you to 'set it and go'. The large LCD display provides instructions and diagnostics while keeping you updated on the cycle status and time remaining. Stackable or Side by Side? Your Choice. Less space? Try stacking the washer and dryer. More space? Place them side by side or under a counter. Don't want to bend down so far to load or unload clothing? Add their tall drawer pedestals. They're also a great place to store laundry products. Sanitary Cycle Get tough stains and bacteria out of dirty clothes with this special cycle that boosts water to 158 F. Load Size Sensing Indicator Determines the size of the load so you can gauge how much detergent to use. The benefit is that you will only use the amount of detergent you need, saving you money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5137vioO9kL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LG","source_asin":"B001URX1SU","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001URX1SU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001URX1SU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
