window.products.push({"id":155312,"name":"Portable Mini Foldable Clothes Washing Machine,Portable Laundry Bucket Washer with Spin Dryer Bucket for Automatic Home Travel Self-Driving Tour Under","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FNLbouHvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【TOUCH CONTROL IS SIMPLE】: One-button operation, simple and convenient long press for 2 seconds to start, short press for 1 second to start, 4 minutes to spin dry, 10 minutes to wash, 5 minutes to rinse.Silent design 58 decibels, strong speed, use high-frequency vibration to effectively remove dirt, no residue and irritation. Mini Foldable Washer Machine with adapter. 【SILENT AND EFFICIENT CLEANING】: Our mini portable washing machine use super quiet technology. Mini Portable Bucket Washer forward and reverse impeller imitating hand washing for ten minutes to quickly clean, the top cover can be used as a washboard, saving you time and water; it can be used to clean baby clothes, underwear, socks, towels, toys, fruits Vegetables and pet supplies. 【FOLDING SIZE IS SUITABLE FOR CARRYING】:Portable washing machine is small and convenient to be folded and only 4 inches thick. You can wash clothes anytime and anywhere,It does not occupy space and is very suitable for small spaces such as dormitories, apartments, RVs, and camping. 【DURABLE AND SAFE MATERIAL】: This washer comes with a draining basket that requires simple assembly. The assembled draining basket is more durable. This item made of food-grade TPR material, very suitable for washing small and thin personal clothes separately to avoid cross-contamination and protect the health of family members. The mini folding washer and spin dryer is perfect for washing baby clothes, underwear and socks. 【THE PERFECT ECONOMICAL GIFT】: Washing things alone saves time, avoids trips to the laundromat, and is more convenient than hand washing. Our lightweight and convenient bucket washer makes it easier to do your laundry outdoors. (Note: The lid of this washing machine is a scrubbing board that can be used with it when necessary.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FNLbouHvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUNDALINDA","source_asin":"B0BFD6W7PR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFD6W7PR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFD6W7PR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
