window.products.push({"id":155442,"name":"Anti-Frost Freezer Mat, No Frost Anti Ice Fridge Cushion, No More Frost/Ice Buildup, Pack of 2, Caidishi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VJDBUhymL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"2X Anti-Frost Freezer Mat Enjoy Frost Free Freezing, Prevents build up of frost and ice in your freezer Simply place in the tottom of your freezer or freezer compartment of your fridge Puts an end to the time-consuming drudgery of manual de-frosting No frost means no blockages in freezer drainage tubes,Easily removed to wipe clean Saves on energy:Frost and ice not only reduces the room available for food, but also means that the fridge has to work harder and is therefore more expensive to run Easily removed to wipe clean Size:47CM*72CM, Approx:18.50\"*9.45\" Instructions for use: Place the Anti-frost Freezer Mat directlly onto the lowest shelf of your freezer for protection from frost. More Anti-frost Freezer Mats can be used for extra frost protection. DO NOT cut the Anti-frost Freezer Mat. Clean with warm soapy water. Package Contain: 2 X Anti-Frost Freezer Mat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VJDBUhymL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caidishi","source_asin":"B01JRZWUQA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JRZWUQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JRZWUQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":155443,"name":"QP2-4.7G Start Relay Refrigerator PTC Ohm 1 Pin Compatible with Vissani Danby Compressor Mini Fridges and Coolers QP2-4R7 4.7 ohm Black 2-Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.45,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j1O4CnzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement Start Relay for Compressor Fixes the following symptoms: Compressor is not starting; Burning hot; \"Click-clack\" about every 3-5 minutes when powered on. Replaces the following part numbers: QP2-4.7/ QP2-4R7/ QP2-4.7G/ 1.03.01.01.039P/ 1.03.01.01.113P/ 1.03.01.01.113PTC/ 1.03.01.01.332PTC/ 2121.50/ 432.45/ 440.41/ 1.4.412.47.25/ 99352.13/ 586.33B/ 310.29/ 036056-001. Compatible models include but are not limited to: EdgeStar, Danby, Summit, Whirlpool, Kenmore, Haier, Igloo, Magic Chef, Vissani, etc. EdgeStar BWC Series Compressor Relay - R134a Compressors PBWC120SS25 Replacement EdgeStar BWC70SS, BWC90SS, BWC90SSLT, BWC120SS, BWC120SSLT Beverage Coolers Specifications: Type: Refrigerator PTC Start Relay Model: QP2-4.7 / QP2-4R7 Pin: 1 pin Resistance: 4.7 ohm Material: Metal and plastic Color: Black Total Size : 1.1''x0.8''x1.1''(L*W*H) Working Principle: When the motor starts up, it has to overcome its inertia and the reaction force of the load. Therefore, it needs large current and torque when the motor starts up. When turn to normal, in order to save energy, large torque and need a drop, add a set of auxiliary to motor coil, work only at boot time, normal after it is disconnected, the PTC thermistor series auxiliary coil at startup, starts the PTC thermistor into the high impedance state to cut off the secondary coil, just can achieve the effect. Note: The picture can tell more than we can, what you see is what you will receive,please make sure it will fit your machine before bidding it. Please check pictures for more details. Package Include: 2 x QP2-4.7G Starter Relays","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61j1O4CnzWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Z","source_asin":"B08Y6PRWY3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155443","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Y6PRWY3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Y6PRWY3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":155444,"name":"Appliance Pros Dryer Repair Kit for Samsung Dryer Belt Kit Includes DC97-16782A Dryer Roller, 6602-001655 Dryer Belt-DC93-00634A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JBXE+TZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacement AP5325135 AP6038887 AP4373659 PS4221885 Package list: 4 X DC97-16782A Dryer Roller 1 X 6602-001655 Idler Belt 1 X DC93-00634A Idler (include 1pc screw) The drum belt is made of black rubber. This goes between the drive motor and the dryer drum. It is thickness is twice as thick as before and it is more durable. 6602-001655 drum belt 92’’Length X 0.3’’, attaches to the motor pulley and causes the drum to spin as the motor is rotating. DC97-16782A drum support roller and axle, which includes the roller shaft and mounting clips, is used in dryers. This part holds the drum as it rotates on the support wheels. When the roller begins to wear out, it self lubricates,so no additional grease is needed. The rollers are designed with a high-quality rubber overall structure, strong and wear-resistant,which make the dryer run stably and quietly. If the dryer makes noise.This kit will needed. BUT before replacing the dryer repair kit, PLEACE do these things first: Unplug the power plug from the wall outlet, remove the corresponding fuse from the fuse box, or flip the corresponding circuit breaker on the breaker panel. Depending on your model, you may need to remove the cabinet of the dryer to access and replace the dryer repair kit Check the parts that need to be replaced with the heater assembly. 4 X DC97-16782A Dryer Roller; 1 X 6602-001655 Idler Belt; 1 X DC93-00634A Idler (include 1pc screw) Check the integrity of the product. Ensure that the product received is brand new. If it is a defective product, it needs to be replaced. When you use the product for a period of time, if the drum support roller makes noise, please drop the lubricating oil on the support roller axle, so the noise problem can be solved. These products are not Samsung original products; Indication of Samsung and any related model designation above is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. The picture on the home page contains the dryer model that this product is perfect","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JBXE+TZOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Appliance Pros","source_asin":"B08XF1GZDD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-155444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XF1GZDD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XF1GZDD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
